[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11765.91, "timestamp": "03:16:05", "text": "これを好きな人は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.59, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "切り抜き画像。うん。ああ、わかりました。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.79, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "想像してみてください。ヌメイは彼女について語る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11775.429, "timestamp": "03:16:15", "text": "ストリーム、ああ、彼女は落ち込んでいる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.07, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "最近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.71, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "バリカンでその部分をカットします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11783.67, "timestamp": "03:16:23", "text": "そして彼女はヌメイがバオを嫌っているのは彼女が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.389, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "最近、バオと交流した。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11787.99, "timestamp": "03:16:27", "text": "ああ、そういう感じですね。ああ、そうですね。うん。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11790.63, "timestamp": "03:16:30", "text": "クリックベイト系のフェイクニュースみたいなもの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11792.229, "timestamp": "03:16:32", "text": "うん、それはまずいね。悪い。ヌメイはこうなる、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11794.87, "timestamp": "03:16:34", "text": "「あぁ、お腹が痛い。」ヌメイは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.83, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "何てことだ。ああ、私は炭酸飲料が結構好きなんです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11804.055, "timestamp": "03:16:44", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "LMAO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.269, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "おお。えっと、彼女は「あぁ、私はゆずが好き」って感じで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11813.95, "timestamp": "03:16:53", "text": "多く。ゆずとんびえは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11817.349, "timestamp": "03:16:57", "text": "セックス。 「一体どういうことだ？」みたいな感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11818.94, "timestamp": "03:16:58", "text": "クリッピング。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11819.434, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "☠☠"}]